# ── Odd-meter electronic grooves (7/8, 5/4, 3/4) ──

# Odd-meter electronic grooves.
# Styles: house, techno, drum_and_bass, dubstep, electronic
# 7/8=14 steps | 5/4=10 steps | 3/4=6 steps | 9/8=18 steps | 11/8=22 steps | 13/8=26 steps
# Beat groups: 7/8=3+2+2, 5/4=3+2, 3/4=1+1+1, 9/8=3+3+3, 11/8=3+3+3+2, 13/8=3+3+3+2+2
# RS (rimshot) stands in for clap
# X = accented hit, x = regular hit, . = rest, o = soft, g = ghost

